# Tool Calling Example - Environment Variables
# ============================================

# OpenAI API Key (required for function calling)
# Get your key at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here

# Note: This example uses OpenAI's function calling feature
# which requires a model that supports it (gpt-4, gpt-4-turbo, gpt-3.5-turbo)
